  "notes": "LitArbi 0.9.65-beta “Paris” (build 69): Word stays as you know it.\n• Citing in Word works through LitArbi’s ribbon add-in, as before (Settings ▸ Add-ins ▸ Microsoft Word).\n• LitArbi for Word, the new add-in for Word, comes to Windows once Microsoft has approved it for the Office Store — until then LitArbi no longer offers to connect it. If you connected it for a test, Settings ▸ Add-ins ▸ LitArbi for Word ▸ Disconnect removes it again."
